\ ── prover sponge (reuses zero16/addblk/finblk/squee from poseidon2.fam) ──
: permh_im   dup 14 lit + over 54 lit + pos2_im 2drop ;
: p2hashim
A0 lit alloc  tuck 8 lit + !  tuck 4 lit + !  tuck !
dup 14 lit + zero16
0 lit over C lit + !
begin  dup C lit + @ 8 lit +  over 4 lit + @ u> invert
while  addblk  permh_im  dup C lit + dup @ 8 lit + swap !
repeat
finblk  permh_im  squee  drop ;

